{"id":"510228b78bbea773","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-finitely-generated.md","title":"Finitely Generated","display":"df-finitely-generated — Finitely Generated","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-finitely-generated","aliases":["58-df-finitely-generated"],"display":"df-finitely-generated — Finitely Generated","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-finitely-generated"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-finitely-generated</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finitely-generated — Finitely Generated"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md\">../batch13/58-df-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Substructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md\">../batch13/58-df-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinitelyGenerated}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinitelyGenerated}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}generated} \\vdash \\mathrm{FinitelyGenerated}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\exists G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\\land\\bigcap\\{\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\mid\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\}=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}generated} \\vdash \\mathrm{FinitelyGenerated}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\exists G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\\land\\bigcap\\{\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\mid\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\}=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finite generation means generation by a finite subset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"563f382027630287","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"563f382027630287","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Substructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinitelyGenerated}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}generated} \\vdash \\mathrm{FinitelyGenerated}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\exists G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\\land\\bigcap\\{\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\mid\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\}=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1283,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-532","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-finitely-generated.md|58-df-finitely-generated]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["563f382027630287","d9b8711cda3f31ca","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}